WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
Select tools by the workflow problem they solve.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.348
Search tools discover sources.

00:00:06.348 --> 00:00:09.521
Note applications preserve context and reasoning.

00:00:09.521 --> 00:00:11.849
Spreadsheets support structured comparison.

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:17.985
Mapping, timeline, and link-analysis tools help organize relationships when the requirement justifies them.

00:00:17.985 --> 00:00:25.391
Archive and capture tools support preservation, but their output still needs source metadata and handling controls.

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:29.411
Automation should reduce repetitive work without hiding provenance.

00:00:29.411 --> 00:00:36.816
An analyst must be able to explain where a record came from and what processing changed.

00:00:36.816 --> 00:00:43.799
Local language models may assist with approved summarization, classification, or drafting when data handling permits.

00:00:43.799 --> 00:00:48.665
Their output can omit context, invent claims, or blur sources.

00:00:48.665 --> 00:00:55.648
Keep human review, cite the original material, and do not treat generated text as evidence.

00:00:55.648 --> 00:01:01.360
Evaluate security, maintenance, export formats, data location, access controls, licensing, and support.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:07.073
A convenient hosted tool may not be appropriate for sensitive case material.

00:01:07.073 --> 00:01:12.786
A local tool may still be unsafe if unpatched or poorly configured.

00:01:12.786 --> 00:01:14.690
Avoid tool sprawl.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:22.096
Too many overlapping utilities increase update burden, inconsistent output, training needs, and opportunities for data leakage.

00:01:22.096 --> 00:01:30.348
Standardize a small supported set, document its role, and retire tools that no longer serve a clear requirement.

00:01:30.348 --> 00:01:36.484
Integrate tools around case identifiers, source logs, file naming, evidence references, and reporting.

00:01:36.484 --> 00:01:40.927
Technology should make the workflow safer and more repeatable.

00:01:40.927 --> 00:01:47.063
It should not replace source validation, analytical reasoning, ethical judgment, or accountable reporting.
